{"seconds": 44.7, "exit": 0, "final": "Perfect! After Qd5+ Kh3 Rxd7, Black is up a full rook (material change +5). The motif is a **fork**\u2014the check to the king forces it to move, leaving the rook on d7 undefended so Black wins it.\n\n**Coaching note (club 1500 player):**\n\nWhen your opponent moves a piece with check, look immediately: does their move leave *another piece undefended*? Qd5+ here forces White's king to move, and suddenly the rook on d7 is hanging. This is called a fork\u2014one move attacks two pieces. The check is the forcing part; winning the loose piece is the payoff.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Qd5+\", \"line\": [\"Qd5+\", \"Kh3\", \"Rxd7\"], \"motifs\": [\"fork\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "1r4k1/1n1Rr2p/4p1p1/2q1PpP1/2P2P1P/p1B5/P3Q1K1/3R4 b - - 1 41"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "1r4k1/1n1Rr2p/4p1p1/2q1PpP1/2P2P1P/p1B5/P3Q1K1/3R4 b - - 1 41"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "1r4k1/1n1Rr2p/4p1p1/2q1PpP1/2P2P1P/p1B5/P3Q1K1/3R4 b - - 1 41", "square": "e2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "1r4k1/1n1Rr2p/4p1p1/2q1PpP1/2P2P1P/p1B5/P3Q1K1/3R4 b - - 1 41", "square": "d7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "1r4k1/1n1Rr2p/4p1p1/2q1PpP1/2P2P1P/p1B5/P3Q1K1/3R4 b - - 1 41", "square": "c3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "1r4k1/1n1Rr2p/4p1p1/2q1PpP1/2P2P1P/p1B5/P3Q1K1/3R4 b - - 1 41", "square": "c5"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "1r4k1/1n1Rr2p/4p1p1/2q1PpP1/2P2P1P/p1B5/P3Q1K1/3R4 b - - 1 41", "square": "e7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "1r4k1/1n1Rr2p/4p1p1/2q1PpP1/2P2P1P/p1B5/P3Q1K1/3R4 b - - 1 41", "square": "b8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "1r4k1/1n1Rr2p/4p1p1/2q1PpP1/2P2P1P/p1B5/P3Q1K1/3R4 b - - 1 41"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "1r4k1/1n1Rr2p/4p1p1/2q1PpP1/2P2P